 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Because: porque (causa)",
    "@en": "Because: because."
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Because** + frase explica por qué ocurre algo: **I'm tired because I worked late** (estoy cansada porque trabajé hasta tarde). También puede ir al principio: **Because I worked late, I'm tired**.",
     "@en": "**Because** + sentence explains why something happens: **I'm tired because I worked late** (I'm tired because I worked late). You can also go to the beginning: **Because I worked late, I'm tired**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "So: así que (resultado)",
    "@en": "So: so (result)"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**So** introduce un resultado: **It rained, so we stayed home** (llovió, así que nos quedamos en casa). Para unir las mismas dos ideas, elige **because** o **so**: no digas **Because it rained, so we stayed home**.",
     "@en": "**So** introduces a result: **It rained, so we stayed home** (it rained, so we stayed home). To join the same two ideas, choose **because** or **so**: do not say **Because it rained, so we stayed home**."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "But: pero (contraste)",
    "@en": "But: but (contrast)"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**But** une dos ideas que contrastan: **I'm tired, but I'm happy** (estoy cansada, pero contenta).",
     "@en": "**But** joins two ideas that contrast: **I'm tired, but I'm happy** (I am tired, but happy)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Also: también; además (añade información)",
    "@en": "Also: also; in addition (add information)"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Also** añade otra idea: **Also, there was a huge crowd at the station** (además, había una multitud enorme en la estación).",
     "@en": "**Also** adds another idea: **Also, there was a huge crowd at the station** (in addition, there was a huge crowd at the station)."
    }
   ]
  },
